        <div class="bio-grid">
            <!-- Gregory Gordon -->
            <div class="bio-card gregory">
                <div class="bio-avatar-row">
                    <div class="bio-avatar gregory-av">GG</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="bio-name">Gregory Gordon</h3>
                        <span class="bio-role">Actor • Martial Artist • Director</span>
                        <br>
                        <a href="https://www.imdb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bio-imdb">IMDb</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bio-text">
                    <p>Gregory Gordon is a dynamic force in independent martial arts cinema — a skilled practitioner, actor, and filmmaker whose work fuses traditional discipline with modern cinematic energy. With over two decades of training across multiple kung fu styles, Gregory brings authentic combat choreography and raw physicality to every frame.</p>
                    <p>As co-founder of <strong>The AG Vibe</strong>, Gregory has written, directed, and starred in numerous kung fu short films that have garnered a dedicated following on YouTube. His creative vision blends Hong Kong cinema aesthetics with fresh, street-level storytelling.</p>
                    <ul class="bio-highlights">
                        <li>20+ years of martial arts training</li>
                        <li>Specializes in Wing Chun, Hung Gar & modern wushu</li>
                        <li>Writer & director of multiple award-nominated shorts</li>
                        <li>Featured in independent action films & web series</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Apryl -->
            <div class="bio-card apryl">
                <div class="bio-avatar-row">
                    <div class="bio-avatar apryl-av">AP</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="bio-name">Apryl</h3>
                        <span class="bio-role">Actress • Martial Artist • Choreographer</span>
                        <br>
                        <a href="https://www.imdb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bio-imdb">IMDb</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bio-text">
                    <p>Apryl is a versatile performer and fight choreographer whose powerful screen presence and technical precision have made her a standout in the indie kung fu scene. Training since childhood in both traditional and contemporary martial arts, she brings elegance and intensity to every role.</p>
                    <p>As the co-creative force of <strong>The AG Vibe</strong>, Apryl co-stars in and co-produces the channel's acclaimed short films. Her choreography emphasizes fluidity, realism, and storytelling through movement — earning praise from martial arts cinema enthusiasts worldwide.</p>
                    <ul class="bio-highlights">
                        <li>15+ years of martial arts & dance training</li>
                        <li>Proficient in Shaolin forms, Tai Chi & kickboxing</li>
                        <li>Lead fight choreographer for AG Vibe productions</li>
                        <li>Featured performer in international martial arts showcases</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
